open-switcher (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial public GitHub Release package.
  * Package daemon, tray, settings UI, desktop launchers, icon, udev rule, and
    user systemd units.
  * Support the initial EN/RU desktop workflow on Ubuntu GNOME Wayland and
    Linux Mint Cinnamon X11.

